# <%= classify(name) %>

NestJS 11 + TypeORM (PostgreSQL) monorepo (<%= apps.join(', ') %>). Generated with [nest-schematics](https://www.npmjs.com/package/nest-schematics). The frontend is [fuse-schematics](https://www.npmjs.com/package/fuse-schematics) (Fuse Admin, Angular).

## Ishga tushirish

```bash
cp .env.example .env            # DB_* va ADMIN_* qiymatlarini to'ldiring
docker compose up -d postgres   # yoki o'zingizning PostgreSQL
npm install
npm run start:dev               # = start:dev:api; kutilayotgan migratsiyalar avval ishlaydi
npm run seed                    # boshlang'ich ma'lumotlar (ixtiyoriy)
```

- API: `http://localhost:3000/api`
- Health: `http://localhost:3000/api/health` (`/live`, `/ready`)
- Swagger: `http://localhost:3000/docs` (`/docs/admin`, `/docs/client`; `SWAGGER_ENABLED=false` bilan o'chadi, prod'da `SWAGGER_USER`/`SWAGGER_PASSWORD` shart)
- OpenAPI: `npm run swagger:export` → `openapi/admin.json`, `openapi/client.json` (DB kerak emas); klient: `npm run g -- openapi-client --name admin --target ../admin/src/app/core/api`
- Kirish: `POST /api/auth/sign-in` `{ email, password }` → `{ accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn, user }` (birinchi super admin `.env` dagi `ADMIN_EMAIL`/`ADMIN_PASSWORD` dan yaratiladi)

