## Tuzilma

```
apps/
├── api/src/
│   ├── main.ts                 # prefix /api, ValidationPipe, CORS, helmet, compression, shutdown hooks, Swagger
│   ├── api.module.ts           # Config + Throttler + Database + Health + Auth + CRUD modullar
│   ├── health/                 # /api/health (DB ping, heap), /live, /ready
│   ├── auth/                   # admin auth: sessiyalar, rollar, admin/admins, admin/roles, AdminGuard, @AdminResource
│   └── modules/                # generatsiya qilingan CRUD modullar
libs/
├── database/src/               # @app/database
│   ├── base.entity.ts          # uuid id, createdAt, updatedAt, deletedAt (soft delete)
│   ├── entities/               # barcha entity'lar + index.ts barrel
│   ├── migrations/             # migratsiyalar + index.ts (ishga tushish tartibi)
│   ├── seeds/                  # seed'lar + index.ts (ro'yxat), seeder.ts (interfeys)
│   ├── database.module.ts      # TypeORM (autoLoadEntities, SnakeNamingStrategy, migratsiyalar)
│   ├── data-source.ts          # migratsiya CLI va seed uchun
│   └── seed.ts                 # `npm run seed`
└── common/src/                 # @app/common
    ├── auth/                   # SessionManager (refresh rotatsiyasi, qurilmalar), argon2, login limiti
    ├── base/                   # BaseCrudService, BaseCrudController
    ├── swagger/                # admin/client hujjatlari, ApiPaginatedResponse, DB'siz eksport
    ├── config/                 # env tekshiruvi, rate limit sozlamasi
    ├── dto/table-query.dto.ts  # PrimeNG TableQueryDTO + { count, data }
    ├── query/table-query.ts    # xavfsiz filter/sort/qidiruv
    ├── decorators/             # @AdminAccess, @Public, @RequirePermissions, @AuthThrottle
    └── filters/                # yagona xato formati (PG xatolari → 400/409)
test/                           # e2e testlar (supertest)
tools/migration.js              # migration:generate/create yordamchisi
Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml  # api image (multi-stage) va lokal stack
```

## Admin auth va sessiyalar

- Tokenlar: access (`ADMIN_JWT_EXPIRES_IN`, 15m) va refresh (`ADMIN_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN`, 30d), alohida secret'lar (`ADMIN_JWT_SECRET`, `ADMIN_REFRESH_SECRET`, har biri 32+ belgi).
- Har kirish bitta sessiya (qurilma): `x-device-id`, `x-device-name`, `x-platform`, `x-app-version` header'lari saqlanadi. `ADMIN_SESSION_LIMIT` dan oshsa, eng eskisi chiqariladi.
- `POST /api/auth/refresh` har safar yangi juftlik beradi; eski refresh qayta kelsa, butun sessiya bekor qilinadi.
- Sessiyalar: `GET /api/auth/sessions`, `DELETE /api/auth/sessions/:id`, `DELETE /api/auth/sessions/others`, `POST /api/auth/sign-out`, `POST /api/auth/sign-out-all`, `POST /api/auth/change-password`.
- Boshqaruv: `admin/admins` (bloklash, rol, parol, sessiyalar), `admin/roles` (ruxsatlar `<resource>.read|write`, `*` = super), `GET admin/permissions` (katalog).
- Parol bilan kirish: IP bo'yicha `@AuthThrottle()` va email+IP bo'yicha 15 daqiqada 5 ta xato urinish.

## CRUD modul qo'shish

```bash
npm run g -- crud product --fields "name:string,price:number,active:boolean,note:text?,status:enum(draft|published)"
```

Natija:

- `libs/database/src/entities/product.entity.ts` (+ `entities/index.ts` ga export)
- `apps/api/src/modules/product/`: DTO (create/update/query), service, controller, module
- `ProductModule` `apps/api/src/api.module.ts` ga avtomatik ulanadi
- migratsiya (`migrations/` + `index.ts` ro'yxati) va ruxsatlar (`product.read`, `product.write`)

Maydon turlari: `string(N)`, `text`, `int`, `number`, `decimal(p,s)`, `boolean`, `date`, `json`, `enum(a|b)`, `relation(Category)`, `relation(Tag[])`, `file(image)` (`upload` add-on kerak). Modifikatorlar: `unique`, `index`, `default(v)`, `min(n)`, `max(n)`, `cascade`, `set-null`, `label(field)`; oxiridagi `?` maydonni ixtiyoriy qiladi:

```bash
npm run g -- crud product --fields "name:string:unique,price:decimal(12,2):default(0),category:relation(Category),tags:relation(Tag[])?"
```

Endpointlar `admin/product` ostida va Angular `BaseCrudService` bilan bir xil:

| Metod | Yo'l | Vazifa |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/admin/product` | hammasi (sahifasiz) |
| POST | `/api/admin/product/pagination` | PrimeNG jadval → `{ count, data }` |
| POST | `/api/admin/product/pagination/archive` | arxiv (soft-delete) |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/:id` | bitta yozuv |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/archive/:id` | arxivdagi yozuv |
| POST | `/api/admin/product` | yaratish |
| PUT | `/api/admin/product/:id` | tahrirlash |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/product/:id` | arxivga o'tkazish |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/repair/:id` | arxivdan tiklash |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/options?search=&ids=` | select uchun `[{ id, label }]` |

## Migratsiyalar

Sxema faqat migratsiyalar orqali o'zgaradi: `DB_SYNCHRONIZE=false` (productionda `true` qiymati qabul qilinmaydi). Migratsiyalar `libs/database/src/migrations/index.ts` dagi ro'yxatdan olinadi; ilova ishga tushganda kutilayotganlari avtomatik qo'llanadi (`DB_MIGRATIONS_RUN=true`, bir nechta instansiya bo'lsa ham advisory lock bilan bir marta).

```bash
npm run migration:generate -- add-product      # entity'ni o'zgartirgandan keyin
npm run migration:run                            # yoki shunchaki api'ni ishga tushiring
npm run migration:revert                         # oxirgisini qaytarish
npm run migration:show                           # qaysilari qo'llangan
```

`migration:generate` va `migration:create` yangi klassni `migrations/index.ts` ga o'zi qo'shadi. `--name=add-product` ko'rinishi ham ishlaydi (npm 11 ogohlantirish beradi).

## Seed'lar

Seed — boshlang'ich yoki demo ma'lumot. Har bir seed **idempotent** bo'lishi kerak (qayta ishga tushirilsa, takrorlanmaydi).

```bash
npm run g -- seed categories            # libs/database/src/seeds/categories.seed.ts + ro'yxatga qo'shish
npm run g -- seed demo-products --dev-only
npm run seed                            # hammasi (ro'yxat tartibida)
npm run seed -- categories              # faqat bittasi
```

`devOnly: true` seed'lar `NODE_ENV=production` bo'lganda o'tkazib yuboriladi.

## Health va rate limit

- `GET /api/health`: DB ping va heap (512 MB); `GET /api/health/live`: jarayon tirikligi (DB'siz); `GET /api/health/ready`: DB ulanishi. Hammasi `@Public()`, rate limit'siz; muammo bo'lsa 503.
- Global limit: har bir IP uchun `THROTTLE_LIMIT` so'rov / `THROTTLE_TTL` soniya (100/min).
- Kirish route'lari `@AuthThrottle()` bilan: daqiqasiga `AUTH_THROTTLE_LIMIT` (5) so'rov. Webhook'lar uchun `@SkipThrottle()`.
- IP `X-Forwarded-For` dan faqat `TRUST_PROXY` (masalan `1`, nginx ortida) berilganda olinadi.

## Docker

```bash
docker compose up -d postgres     # faqat DB (lokal ishlab chiqish)
docker compose up --build         # DB + api (production image)
```

`Dockerfile` multi-stage: dependency'lar, `npm run build:api`, keyin faqat production `node_modules` va `dist/apps/api` bilan `node` foydalanuvchisi ostida ishlaydi. Add-on'lar (`redis`, `tusd`, ...) `docker-compose.yml` ga o'z servislarini qo'shadi.

## Testlar va kod sifati

- `npm test`: unit testlar (`apps/**` va `libs/**` dagi `*.spec.ts`), masalan `libs/common/src/config/env.validation.spec.ts`.
- `npm run test:e2e`: `test/health.e2e-spec.ts` butun api'ni `.env` dagi DB bilan ishga tushiradi va supertest bilan tekshiradi.
- `npm run lint`: ESLint flat config (`eslint.config.mjs`); formatlash qoidalari Prettier'da (`npm run format`).
